1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:01,534
It's raining.

2
00:00:02,534 --> 00:00:03,753
Lily has a plan.

3
00:00:03,903 --> 00:00:05,451
A very productive plan.

4
00:00:05,851 --> 00:00:08,866
Lily: Today, I will finally become a better person!

5
00:00:14,567 --> 00:00:15,456
Page one.

6
00:00:16,556 --> 00:00:17,831
Fifteen photos.

7
00:00:19,231 --> 00:00:20,813
Zero pages after that.

8
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:35,773
Lily: I'm doing… the relaxing position.

9
00:00:39,973 --> 00:00:42,487
The relaxing position lasted two hours.

10
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:04,762
Mom: You said you'd clean.

11
00:01:04,812 --> 00:01:06,242
Mom: It looks worse.

12
00:01:06,842 --> 00:01:09,032
Lily: It's… a process, Mom.

13
00:01:26,033 --> 00:01:28,002
Rain makes everything taste better.

14
00:01:29,302 --> 00:01:31,032
Especially instant noodles.

15
00:01:32,032 --> 00:01:34,103
And the second pack of instant noodles.

16
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:45,132
Max: The rain stopped!

17
00:01:45,132 --> 00:01:46,294
Max: Let's go out!

18
00:01:52,494 --> 00:01:54,413
Lily: …I think it might rain again.

19
00:02:06,300 --> 00:02:08,053
Plans completed: none.

20
00:02:12,153 --> 00:02:15,497
But sometimes, a rainy day isn't for being productive.

21
00:02:16,097 --> 00:02:17,191
It's for resting.

22
00:02:17,791 --> 00:02:18,816
And noodles.

23
00:02:20,116 --> 00:02:21,233
Lily: Tomorrow.

24
00:02:21,733 --> 00:02:23,876
Lily: I'll be a better person tomorrow.
